/* 城镇后半年六节日 × 5 段 + 1 个入口 hub = 31 passages / 准备 -> 冲突 -> 选择 -> 结算 -> 余波 / 入口：MP Town Festivals 2 Hub */
:: MP Town Festivals 2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
高街布告栏左侧的铜框里换上了另外半年的六张节庆水牌，木牌用桐油刷过，边角分别烙着犁铧、日晷、潮钟、校徽、防风灯与双锤铜钟的印记。塞拉站在木架旁替最上面一块木牌换上新麻绳，说这六场节令横跨田垄、海岸、学园与神殿，每一场背后都有几桩没理顺的旧账。
街口吹来的风带着一点新翻泥土与海盐的气息。你把六块木牌按时令翻看了一遍，每块木牌背面都用粉笔标着集合的街口与时辰。

<br><br>

<<link [[看旧界铜片 (0:04)|MP Festival Plough 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[看日晷白线 (0:04)|MP Festival Solstice 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[看退潮古钟 (0:04)|MP Festival Tide 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查走廊画框 (0:04)|MP Festival Term 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查受潮灯芯 (0:04)|MP Festival Lantern 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[查钟塔钢销 (0:04)|MP Festival Chime 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

<br><br>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>


<br>
<<link [[看前半年水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>


/* ==================== 1. 初春开犁节 (Plough) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Plough 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
初春的薄霜还挂在河湾农场的田埂枯草上，村里按照老规矩牵出了披红布的领头挽马。
你蹲下身拨开犁头下方的冻土，指尖在一块松动的田界石下摸到了半片刻着字码的黄铜契片。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-plough-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "扶犁试拉半垄 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-plough-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 270>>
	你顺着犁尖的磨损纹路一寸寸比对，帮亚历克斯把垫偏的木楔抽出来重新打紧。亚历克斯试着推了推犁把，紧绷的肩膀顿时松了下来。<<set $mpFestivalClues["plough_wedge"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶犁试拉半垄 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[带契片去高街 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["plough_shard"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冻土又硬又滑，你用力去扳配重铁块时手掌在生锈的铁棱上擦出一道红印，犁尖反而陷得更深了。亚历克斯叹了口气，让你先退到田埂边暖手。<<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Plough 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Plough 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
上午的高街临时搭起了春耕铁器摊，炉火烧得噼啪作响。塞拉提着工具匣走来，目光落在木箱里刚从河湾农场收来的旧犁头上——犁头内侧还留着清晰的犁头铜印。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-plough-2">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "指铜印给众人 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-plough-2">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_plough_2")>><</if>>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 270>>
	你拿过摊面上的定金底单，当场按旧犁头的净重与生铁折价一笔笔重算。<<set $mpFestivalClues["plough_account"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 250>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[指铜印给众人 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[押犁头回农场 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	账单上的生铁折算写得密密麻麻，你看了一会儿便被满纸的分数绕晕了头。农具商冷笑着把底单合上，催促不买的人别挡着摊位做生意。<<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Plough 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Plough 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
正午刚过，西北天际忽然压下一片铅灰色的春雨云。亚历克斯拽着马缰分不开身，冲你大喊着让你拿主意。田埂边的帮工们手忙脚乱，不知该先往哪边扑。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-plough-3">
<<runicon>><<link "拉通第一犁沟 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-plough-3">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_plough_3")>><</if>>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
	你抄起铁镐跳进泥沟，看准老树根的受力节三镐劈断主根。两边都没耽误，亚历克斯隔着雨幕朝你竖起了大拇指。<<set $mpFestivalClues["plough_saved"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 350>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拉通第一犁沟 (0:06)|MP Festival Plough 4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[擦马换干套 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你在泥地里深一脚浅一脚地来回奔忙，撬树根时铁镐滑脱震麻了虎口。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Plough 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Plough 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
春雨在下午三点骤然放晴，湿润的黑土在阳光下泛着油亮的光泽。
先前在集市上理亏的农具商也跟着马车赶到了田头，当众把克扣的旧犁头与修犁贴补交还给农场。亚历克斯擦去额头的汗水，当着众人的面请你在开犁册上签下名字。

<br><br>

<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_plough_4")>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($tending or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	<<set _pay to (_sk gte 450 ? 1100 : _sk gte 350 ? 750 : 450)>>
	你把田界石下的黄铜契片与高街核对清的定金单并排放在红木托盘上，原本还想找借口的农具商彻底哑口无言，乖乖补足了今年的春耕赏金。<<if _first>><<money _pay>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
	你虽然累得手臂发酸，没能把契片的来历说全，但亚历克斯还是替你接过了话头，帮你保住了应得的那份劳务红封。<<if _first>><<money 300>><</if>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[端麦饼去高街 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[谷仓前喝麦茶 (0:05)|MP Festival Plough 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Plough 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
暮色四合时，高街面包房外摆开了长桌。农夫与街坊们捧着陶碗围坐交谈，白天的争执在麦香与热汤里化开了大半。亚历克斯把一只装着优选春麦种与干薄荷的小布袋塞进你怀里，塞拉也在一旁替你把那半片黄铜界契磨平了毛刺，栓上红绳给你做平安坠。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-plough-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前应对 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-plough-5">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_plough_5")>><</if>>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	你在长桌旁替老铁匠与佃户们斟满热麦茶，几句得体的劝和话让两边终于碰了碗。<<if _first>><<money 400>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你不善应酬热闹的敬酒词，坐在长桌尾端安静地啃完了一整块热麦饼，结果反倒被呛得连声咳嗽，引来亚历克斯善意的轻笑。<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Plough 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
/* ==================== 2. 夏季长日节 (Solstice) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Solstice 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
一年中白昼最长的清晨，公园中央的圆石日晷四周已经拉起了彩布凉棚。
你走近石台细看，白漆还没完全干透，石座下方的草丛里掉着半截涂漆用的细毛刷。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[留树荫下歇息 (0:02)|Park]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-solstice-1">
<<beachicon>><<link "顺白漆痕去海滩 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-solstice-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	你借着晨光投下的晷针角度算出真正的子午线，用湿帕子蘸了一点草本酒精。诺艾尔松了一口气，把一枝清凉的薄荷叶别在你的衣领上。<<set $mpFestivalClues["solstice_sundial"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺白漆痕去海滩 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<parkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>><<link [[搬草药进棚 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">搬草药进棚 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	你拿树枝去刮那道白漆，不仅没刮干净，反而把白漆蹭到了自己的袖口上。争抢摊位的小贩见状吵得更凶了，震得你太阳穴直跳。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Solstice 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Solstice 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
十一点的太阳把海滩晒得发白，木栈道边的柠檬冰水摊前围满了满头大汗的游客。格威岚的遮阳篷还没支稳，原本要分给公园茶棚的备用碎冰不知去向，旁边的流动木车底却滴着冰水。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[去吹海风 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-solstice-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "支起遮阳篷 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-solstice-2">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_solstice_2")>><</if>>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>>
	你绕到流动木车背阴处，一眼看出底板暗格里藏着印有格威岚杂货铺记号的锡制冰匣。格威岚笑眯眯地走上前拎回冰匣，分了你几枚亮晶晶的谢礼硬币。<<set $mpFestivalClues["solstice_ice"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 250>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[支起遮阳篷 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[拎碎冰回公园 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你刚靠近流动木车就被摊主警觉地挡住了去路，烈日晃得你眼花，没能找到藏冰的证据，只能在滚烫的沙地上白晒了一身汗。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Solstice 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Solstice 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
正午十二点整，太阳悬在公园最高处，日晷的铜针几乎没有影子。长日节的传统竞走与花环传递即将开始，水柱正对着挂满彩带的音响木箱直喷。诺艾尔正忙着给守园人喂解暑药水，周围的游人还没察觉水柱快要漫过电线。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-solstice-3">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "戴花环绕草坪 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-solstice-3">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_solstice_3")>><</if>>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($tending or 0) gte 270>>
	你一个箭步冲进水雾里，用湿毛巾裹住滚烫的黄铜阀门一把拧死。<<set $mpFestivalClues["solstice_gong"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 350>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[戴花环绕草坪 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<beachicon>><<link [[随游行队去海滩 (0:06)|MP Festival Solstice 4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你踩在湿草皮上滑了一跤，等费力拧紧阀门时裤腿已经湿透，正午铜锣也比钟塔慢了半拍才敲响。好在没有弄坏木箱，只是累得你气喘吁吁。<<pain 1>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Solstice 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Solstice 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
傍晚七点，太阳依然高悬在海平面上方，金红色的晚霞将整片浅滩映得如同白昼。海滩搭起了长日篝火架，镇民们围着木栈道交换编织的香草花环与冰镇果酒。
白天涂改日晷又偷藏碎冰的流动摊主被几个老街坊认了出来，正红着脸在更衣木屋旁赔不是。格威岚晃着两杯加了薄荷与碎冰的柠檬特饮走过来，把其中一杯递到你手里。

<br><br>

<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_solstice_4")>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	<<set _pay to (_sk gte 450 ? 1100 : _sk gte 350 ? 800 : 450)>>
	你从容地出面主持了摊位和解，让那名摊主把剩下的三箱冰汽水免费分给中暑的游客抵过，庆典筹备会当场把今年的秩序津贴交到了你手里。<<if _first>><<money _pay>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
	你站在一旁看格威岚三言两语把那摊主训得低下了头，自己也分到了一小份帮忙跑腿的茶水钱。<<if _first>><<money 300>><</if>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<parkicon>><<link [[暮色回公园看花 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿浅滩拾贝壳 (0:05)|MP Festival Solstice 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Solstice 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
直到夜里十点，天边才终于合拢最后一缕紫蓝色的暮光。公园草坪上的彩灯一盏接一盏亮起，晚风吹散了白昼积攒的暑气。诺艾尔与罗宾并肩坐在喷泉石沿上，身旁放着一只装满冰镇甜莓茶的玻璃罐。
见你走过来，罗宾笑着递给你一只编着干雏菊的草环，诺艾尔则往你手心里放了一小包晒干的安神薰衣草。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-solstice-5">
