/* ==================== 3. 旧港潮汐节 (Tide) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Tide 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
大潮退到年度最低点的清晨，旧港防波堤下露出了平时深埋水底的青石基座与一排系着铜牌的古老铁环。
栈桥下方的浮标链紧绷着，退潮露出的石槽壁上隐约可见几行早年留下的石槽刻字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-tide-1">
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link "跟维斯去船坞 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-tide-1">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 270 or ($athletics or 0) gte 270>>
	你踩着湿滑的牡蛎石阶下到齐膝深的水线边，看准涌浪退去的空当一把割断缠死在石桩上的废渔网。维斯低声赞了一句，把一枚刻着旧潮位的铜牌递给你保管。<<set $mpFestivalClues["tide_buoy"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[跟维斯去船坞 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">跟维斯去船坞 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[看浮标链石槽字 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["tide_carving"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石阶上的绿苔滑得惊人，你刚伸手去拽铁链，脚底一滑差点跌进冰凉的潮水坑里，手背还被牡蛎壳划出一道白印。<<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Tide 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">跟维斯去梅尔街船坞 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Tide 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
梅尔街三号干船坞外挂起了彩旗，但悬挂在拱门中央的那口古铜退潮钟却迟迟没人敲响。雷恩靠在旁边的缆桩上抛着一枚银币，朝你使了个眼色，示意那半张旧章程的背面其实写着补充条款。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-tide-2">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "握麻绳敲钟 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-tide-2">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_tide_2")>><</if>>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 270>>
	你上前接过那张泛黄的羊皮章程，当众念出背面小字：凡遇十年一遇的低潮日。两名老舵手愣了片刻，双双把钟绳让到了你和维斯手里。<<set $mpFestivalClues["tide_charter"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 300>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握麻绳敲钟 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link [[问船坞暗箱 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问船坞暗箱 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	章程上的古旧海事术语拗口难懂，你念得磕磕绊绊，反而让两边的船工吵得更起劲了，震得你耳朵嗡嗡作响。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Tide 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Tide 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
浑厚的铜钟声荡过海面，紧接着潮水开始以肉眼可见的速度回涨。
海浪一波比一波高，维斯已经发动了快艇引擎，朝岸边的你伸出手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回栈桥 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-tide-3">
<<swimicon>><<link "乘船回梅尔街 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-tide-3">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_tide_3")>><</if>>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 280 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
	你抓着快艇舷绳探身入水，借着回流巧劲将撬棍插进石缝。<<set $mpFestivalClues["tide_box"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 400>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[乘船回梅尔街 (0:06)|MP Festival Tide 4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[抬木箱去船坞 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰冷的回流打得你重心不稳，你费了九牛二虎之力才和船工一起用绞盘拽正浮筒，膝盖在船帮上撞得生疼，那只夹层铜盒也滑进了深水沟。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Tide 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Tide 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
下午涨平的港湾里千帆并列，领航船在梅尔街石阶前缓缓靠岸。港务长官打开了从浮筒下起出的防水账匣，里面封存着近三年各船队缴纳的灯油公益金底单——原来有几笔款项被前任记账员记在了报废船只名下。维斯与雷恩站在人群外围，示意你把核对出来的差额当场报给老舵手们听。

<br><br>

<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_tide_4")>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($maths or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 290>>
	<<set _pay to (_sk gte 460 ? 1200 : _sk gte 360 ? 850 : 500)>>
	你声音清晰地报出三笔报废船名的账目流水，港务长官核对印鉴后当场拍板，将追回的灯油结余充入今年护航公费，并按海事惯例拨给你一笔丰厚的清标红利。<<if _first>><<money _pay>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<<else>>
	你被几十双水手的眼睛盯着，报数时漏了一行小字，幸好维斯在旁补了一句才算圆场，你也领到了一份基础的辛劳赏金。<<if _first>><<money 320>><</if>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[放祈愿木牌 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[栈桥边喝热茶 (0:05)|MP Festival Tide 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Tide 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
入夜后的旧港水面上漂浮着上百块点着红烛的祈愿木牌，随着平缓的夜潮向远海漂去。防波堤尽头的雾角灯塔射出明亮的光束，一下下扫过寂静的船桅。维斯靠在石栏边，将一枚打磨光滑的古旧船锚铜章抛进你怀里；不远处的雷恩也朝你举了举锡酒壶，算是记下了你今天的人情。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
