:: MP Festival Term 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
放学后的高街洒满金黄的夕阳，三三两两的学生围在旧书摊前挑选夹有干花的开学祭黄铜书签。悉尼帮你把一摞借来的古籍装回木箱，惠特尼则叼着棒棒糖从街对面晃过去，顺手把一只折得方方正正的纸飞机弹进了你的书包侧袋。
打开纸飞机一看，里面包着两枚游戏厅代币和一行潦草的「算你手快」。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-term-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "上前处置 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-term-5">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_term_5")>><</if>>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	你帮书摊老人把剩下的纪念书签按年代分册夹好，老人笑呵呵地送了你一枚刻着猫头鹰纹样的纯铜书签和几张零钞。<<if _first>><<money 350>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你蹲在书箱边理了半天书页，夕阳晒得后背发懒，虽然没挑出稀有版本，心里却觉得格外踏实。<<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Term 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
/* ==================== 5. 秋末点灯节 (Lantern) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Lantern 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
秋末寒雾初起的傍晚，神殿侧廊的长桌上整齐排列着上百盏黄铜防风灯，准备在入夜后分送去孤儿院与各条暗巷。乔丹正拿着银剪修整棉灯芯，伸手一摸却发现最底下那箱送往孤儿院的灯芯被地窖潮气浸软了，点起来只会冒黑烟。
距离点灯仪式只剩不到一个时辰，神殿外已经能听见孩子们盼望提灯的脚步声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-lantern-1">
<<walkicon>><<link "提风灯去孤儿院 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-lantern-1">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
	你立刻端来干燥的香炉余灰与吸油棉纸，将受潮的灯芯一根根夹在温热的铜板间烘干，又浸上掺了松香的清油。乔丹试着点亮一盏，火苗澄澈温暖，没有半点黑烟。<<set $mpFestivalClues["lantern_wick"] to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[提风灯去孤儿院 (0:05)|MP Festival Lantern 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<templeicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[帮乔丹装油 (0:05)|MP Festival Lantern 2]]>><<set $mpFestivalClues["lantern_oil"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮乔丹装油 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	你急着把灯芯凑到烛火边烘烤，不小心燎焦了三根棉芯，呛人的油烟味在侧廊里散开，急得你手心直冒汗。<<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Lantern 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Lantern 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
孤儿院走廊里冷风嗖嗖，罗宾正带着几个小孤儿在窗台边擦拭挂钩。然而贝利手下的一名管事却堵在楼梯口，冷冷地说灯油熏黑了墙壁还得花钱粉刷。
几个孩子抱紧纸灯笼低下头，罗宾看向你手里从神殿借来的备用灯罩与铜灯箱。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-lantern-2">
<<templeicon>><<link "回神殿取灯罩 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-lantern-2">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_lantern_2")>><</if>>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 270 or ($english or 0) gte 270>>
	你当着管事的面旋亮一盏烘过松香的防风灯，将白瓷碟悬在灯罩上方半分钟——瓷碟底部洁白如新。<<set $mpFestivalClues["lantern_clean"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 250>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[回神殿取灯罩 (0:05)|MP Festival Lantern 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<tendingicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[加固走廊挂钩 (0:05)|MP Festival Lantern 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">加固走廊挂钩 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	你被管事刻薄的眼神盯得语气发虚，拧灯芯时手一抖。管事趁机不依不饶，最后还是罗宾答应明早擦墙才算勉强放行。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Lantern 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Lantern 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
暮色彻底沉下来时，神殿庭院外忽然刮起一阵夹着冷雨星的秋风。挂在连廊拱门上的主引火灯被风吹得剧烈摇晃，防风罩的卡扣松脱了一半；而庭院角落堆放的干松针引火包也快被雨星打湿了。
乔丹正在台阶上主持祝祷，阿什提着猎灯从侧门赶来，朝连廊高处指了指。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿庭院 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-lantern-3">
<<walkicon>><<link "护送火种回院 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-lantern-3">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_lantern_3")>><</if>>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 270 or ($tending or 0) gte 270>>
	你踩着石柱底座利落地扣死主引火灯的黄铜防风罩，又把转向风叶拨到背风角，随后将干松针包拢进防潮油布下。主灯火光稳稳映亮整座庭院，阿什向你投来赞许的目光。<<set $mpFestivalClues["lantern_shield"] to 1>><<if _first>><<money 350>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[护送火种回院 (0:06)|MP Festival Lantern 4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[替老人点门灯 (0:05)|MP Festival Lantern 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你在冷风里够了两次才扣上灯罩，滚烫的铜边烫红了指尖，地上的松针包也湿了最外一层，好在主火种总算保住了。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Lantern 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Lantern 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
晚上八点，从狼街神殿到宅邸街孤儿院的整条街巷亮起了一条蜿蜒的暖黄灯河。孤儿院原本阴冷的走廊、楼梯拐角与窗台全部挂上了澄澈的防风铜灯，孩子们围在暖光下分食烤栗子，连平时最偏僻的墙角都驱散了寒意。
乔丹将神殿今年拨给冬日照明的互助金匣交到你与罗宾手中，感谢你今晚两头奔忙。

<br><br>

<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_lantern_4")>><</if>>
