	<br><br>
	<<link [[带怀表对时 (0:05)|MP Festival Chime 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[顺旋梯上钟机房 (0:05)|MP Festival Chime 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你在拥挤的人潮里喊得嗓子发干，推木车时还被洒在地上的热红酒滑了一下，费了老大劲才勉强把工具箱先拎进钟塔侧门。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Festival Chime 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP Festival Chime 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestivalClues to ($mpFestivalClues or {})>>
十一点半，按照全镇年末老规矩，狼街神殿的副钟必须在子夜与高街主钟同时敲响。然而漫天风雪遮住了两座钟塔之间的视线，平时用来传讯的塔顶红灯在雾雪里模糊不清。
你站在神殿钟楼的石拱窗前，手里握着塞拉校准过的三问怀表，另一边则是通往高处风向连廊的狭窄铁梯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-festival-chime-3">
<<runicon>><<link "赶回钟塔广场 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-festival-chime-3">>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_chime_3")>><</if>>
